(Phnom Penh): Mr. Plang Samnang, Judge of the Court of Appeal, is scheduled to hear the case of a former military officer and a former member of Trapeang Phleang commune council, Chhuk district, Kampot province on the afternoon of July 11, 2018. Fraud case by forging documents to sell thousands of hectares of wind land in Kampot province. This is according to an official of the Court of Appeal told Fresh News this morning, July 5, 2018.
