Despite the defendants' denial of the ghost, the prosecution did not find any witnesses or exculpatory evidence that the defendants could present to the court and the public. Their claim is true.
According to the victims, they have submitted strong evidence to the Phnom Penh Municipal Court, including: forged documents used by the accused to defraud them, as well as a forensic certificate from the National Police that The authorities' stamp is a fake letter.
In addition, the victim also has documents confirming that the accused actually received money through several checks totaling $ 800,000 to buy a total of 8,005 hectares of land in Kampot province, but the land All of them are only on fake documents produced by the accused, while the actual land is non-existent, that is, the land is wind land.
According to the forensic record of the competent experts of the National Police, it was clear to the court that the documents for the purchase and sale of land in Kampot province, which the accused Sun Seang and Heng San used to deceive the victims. It is true that the fingerprints of the people who own the land, the signatures and seals of the local authorities have been forged.
Next week, the Court of Appeal is set to prosecute former military and commune officials for forging documents to sell thousands of hectares of wind land in Kampot province following a complaint from prosecutors
Representative of General Neth Savoeun Meets More Than 500 Party Heads in Thmor Puon Commune, Prey Veng Province and Calls for Voting for the CPP for Peace and Development
(Prey Veng): On the morning of July 5, 2018, Thmor Poun Commune Party Office organized a get-together with 554 CPP leaders from 5 out of 11 villages in Thmor Poun Commune, Kanhcheach District, Prey Veng Province.
The ceremony was held in the presence of Mr. Dam Vuthy, Deputy Chairman of the First Working Group of Kanhchiech District and Mr. Sou Savuth, Deputy Working Group of the District Working Group, on behalf of General Neth Savoeun, Net Savoeun, First Team Leader of Svay Antor and Kanhchheak Districts and accompanied by the Working Group Leader. Receive commune chiefs, commune chiefs, party branch sub-branches in all 11 villages in the commune.
On that occasion, Mr. Dam Vuthy sent a message of condolences from Samdech Techo Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian People's Party, Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng, Vice President of the Party, and General Neth Savoeun, Chairman of the Working Group to Assist the People in Ngeach and Svay Antor Districts. As well as throughout the province and thank all the people who continue to support the CPP.
He emphasized that Samdech Techo Hun Sen has had clear policies and strategies in the past mandate, leading the country to peace and development, starting from the bare hands, the ashes left by the Pol Pot regime to be as prosperous as today, especially the mandate. Fifth, the infrastructure is: roads, bridges, hospitals, schools, districts, more and more modern and close to your base.
In addition, he also apologized for the lack of local civil servants who serve the people poorly and all the awkward acts, both intentionally and unintentionally, and instructed the officials to stick with the grassroots to serve the people. Citizens to be good and on time.
After this program, the team continued to bring hot water pipes to the houses of the party heads of the remaining 6 villages who did not come to participate, handing them over to the party heads of the total 2,896 in Thmor Poun commune.
Remarks by Samdech Techo Hun Sen on the Occasion of Meeting with Nearly 30,000 Workers in Kandal Province
(Kandal): Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, on the morning of Thursday, July 5, 2018, met with a total of 27,529 workers. From 25 factories in Kandal province.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen begins a talk with nearly 30,000 workers from 25 factories in Kandal province.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that now Cambodia has moved from a poor country to a low middle income country, and the lives of the people have changed from the past, finding only shoes are not desirable.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that without the 1970 war and the genocidal regime, Cambodia would have been more prosperous. But unfortunately, this war has destroyed Cambodia, Cambodia has struggled to recover.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked all Cambodians for their joint efforts with the Royal Government to restore the country and prevent the return of the genocidal regime. This Samdech Techo is a great legacy and achievement for the people in the present era.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked for the love, kindness and kindness of the workers, which is a strong energy for continuing to lead the country and protect the peace for the nation and people.
* In connection with this, Samdech Techo Hun Sen mentioned an educational story that a dog is carrying a piece of meat in its mouth, but when it carries the meat to reflect in the water, it suddenly sees a shadow of the flesh in the water bigger than the meat in In the mouth, drop the meat in the mouth, want to serve the meat in the water, but eventually lose the meat in the mouth.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the wages of workers and the salaries of civil servants are not limited to that, when the national economy becomes a high middle-income country by 2030 and a high-income country. Higher By 2050, wages and salaries will be higher.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the construction of ports, roads, electricity generation to lower electricity prices is to attract investors so that investors can make a profit, and the profit from that business will help the wages of workers higher. .
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Cambodian People's Party, headed by Samdech, took life as its capital, led a movement to liberate people's lives from the genocidal regime, and then made efforts to prevent the genocide from returning. Further efforts must be made to rebuild the country.
* The President of the Cambodian People's Party stated that peace and development in Cambodia is in the hands of the Cambodian People's Party, not in the hands of the opposition. The opposition only prevented the purchase of Cambodian products and did not allow foreigners to provide aid to Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that we must be proud of the garments made in Cambodia and sold on the world market.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen questioned why investors came to invest in Cambodia at a time when wages are higher than some countries, transportation costs and electricity prices are higher than some countries? Samdech stated that the first attraction is that Cambodia is peaceful and stable, and the other is that Cambodia has a skilled workforce that can meet product quality standards.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen continued that because of this factor, Samdech always called on workers to work hard to improve the quality of products made in Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen questioned whether to keep what is already in hand or to make changes?
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminded that because of the "changes" without considering the 1970s, Cambodia collapsed. Samdech said that one day he defeated Samdech Norodom Sihanouk and another day he replaced Samdech Norodom Sihanouk, Cambodia finally fell into the flames of war.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that on July 7, 2018, which is the opening day of the election campaign, Samdech will announce some policies for the benefit of the people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Cambodian People's Party has grown from only 5 million people to about 16 million people. The CPP has grown from 5 million people lacking rice to about 16 million people who have enough rice and the rest for export.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that if the CNRP was not dissolved, the war in Cambodia could not have escaped. Samdech Techo said that they do politics to unite the nation, but the CNRP does politics to divide the nation.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that when they follow themselves as patriots, when they do not support foreign puppets, so how can national unity happen?
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen announces that he will continue to lead the country for at least 10 years to protect the country from the separatist attempts of the disbanded opposition. Samdech continued that as long as this former opposition leader is still present, Samdech will continue to lead the defense of this country.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that peace in factories is Samdech's wish.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen told the factory owner that if the factory owner has no workers, it is not the name of the factory owner, but only the name of the warehouse owner, while the workers without the factory are unemployed and have no equal pay. In this regard, Samdech calls on employers and workers to work together to create a safe community in the factory.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls on farmers that even if they have cows, do not give up raising cows, if you do not raise cows for plowing, also raise cows.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that so far, Samdech has released more than 20 million dollars to solve the problem of workers who run away from their employers.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen acknowledged that the leadership of Samdech is still lacking, but the good points are more because more good points than that and lead to Cambodia to develop as it is today.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen warns Brad Adams that Cambodia is not under any foreign law
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that because foreigners set themselves as the masters of the Khmer people, millions of Cambodians died in the past, the present Khmer people do not allow foreigners to be the masters, and the Khmer people today do not have a traitor to their fathers. That child too.
* The Prime Minister continues to call on workers to continue to work together to prevent the spread of AIDS.
* Samdech Techo continues to call on authorities at all levels to strive for a neutral environment to ensure a fair and transparent election process.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls on all civil servants not to use state property to campaign, to ensure that state property is not used by any political party, especially the ruling party. .
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen also called on all media outlets to rent airtime to all political parties, while the CPP has already rented out all television stations to broadcast during the election campaign.
* Samdech Techo added that for national television, all political parties must be given equal hours during the election campaign.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen warned the people that the election information card can not be used to vote, that is, only the ID card can be used for the election.
* The Prime Minister stated that he would issue a circular to the people for election day following the request of the National Election Committee.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen continues to call for unity to ensure the success of the election without any fear to the people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that whichever party wins the election is one thing, but more importantly, the whole nation has won through a successful election.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen also reminded workers that they can take three days off for the upcoming election with the same salary.
