Living happily with his family in Wuhan, China has now become Marco's second home.
Minister of Agriculture: Production and supply of safe vegetables in the local market is still limited
(Kampong Cham): The Minister of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries, Mr. Veng Sakhon, said that now that the population of Cambodia is growing steadily from year to year and have a better life, the trend and eating habits have also changed. They pay high attention to the quality and safety of food, especially fresh vegetables and fruits.
However, the production and supply of safe vegetables in the local market is still limited, so increasing the production of safe vegetables and labeling properly is the most necessary work to work together to achieve this goal.
The Minister said so during the fair of safe vegetables and safe products in Kampong Cham province this morning, July 4, 2018 in Sangkat Kampong Cham, Kampong Cham city, Kampong Cham province.
Mr. Veng Sakhon said that according to the previous vegetable survey report, Cambodia imports about 200-400 tons of seasonal vegetables per day, worth about 150-200 million US dollars per year. .
