(Phnom Penh): The Commander of the 70th Brigade Command, Lt. Gen. Mao Sophan, once again announced and ordered that all officers, deputies and soldiers of the 70th Brigade must defend only the Royal A legitimate government that emerges from democratic elections and defends the Constitution, Cambodia's supreme law.
This announcement was made by Lt. Gen. Mao Sophan on the occasion of the closing of the workshop to review and evaluate the work achieved in the first half and the work experience in the second half of 2018 on July 3, 2018 at 70th Brigade Command.
General Mao Sophan emphasized that "All armed forces, in general, the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces, and the 70th Brigade, are committed to the absolute protection of the current peace, stability and political stability that comes from win-win politics." "Of Samdech Techo Prime Minister, no matter what the value, it is necessary to protect the opposition against the color revolution in any form."
In that, the Commander-in-Chief made a plan for all officers, deputies, and soldiers to perform their duties as soldiers in a serious and rigorous manner in accordance with the roles and responsibilities assigned by their superiors according to their respective skills and duties. .
In addition, Lt. Gen. Mao Sophan urged all troops to fulfill their duties as good citizens by going to the 6th National Assembly election to be held on July 29, 2018 to continue to maintain peace. And continue the development of Cambodia.
Finally, the Commander also handed over an incentive budget to all the 127th Battalion of the Subordinate Units with excellent personnel at the 70th Brigade Command.
