(Phnom Penh): The Phnom Penh Capital Administration has issued a notification announcing the recruitment of 43 bus drivers to work at the Phnom Penh Public Transport Authority. This is according to the announcement of Phnom Penh Capital Administration, which was received by Fresh News on the afternoon of July 3, 2018.
