EZECOM Celebrates Cambodian Young Entrepreneur Awards 2018
(Phnom Penh): ZECOM organized a celebration for young Cambodian entrepreneurs after the 2018 Young Entrepreneur Awards and Awards Ceremony.
The event was held at Sokha Phnom Penh Hotel. This year's winners received a total of five awards: Best Entrepreneur of the Year Award, Best Female Entrepreneur Award, Best Social Entrepreneur Award, Smart Technology Award and New Business Award. .
As one of the leading internet service providers in Cambodia and one of the major sponsors of this event, EZECOM would like to congratulate all the winners for their outstanding and attractive business plans. Most.
The Cambodian Young Entrepreneur Award was established in 2015 by the Cambodian Young Entrepreneurs Association (YEAC) and JCI Cambodia with the support of the Ministry of Industry and Handicrafts and the Ministry of Commerce. The Young Entrepreneur Awards event is recognized and supported by both the private and non-private sectors as the largest annual entrepreneurship award in Cambodia.
The Cambodian Young Entrepreneur Award aims to promote entrepreneurship among Cambodian youth, as well as provide opportunities and forums for young people to develop innovative business plans. In addition, the event is also an opportunity to attract new businesses and investments in Cambodia.
EZECOM focuses on promoting the development of technology, services and businesses, which are key sectors in driving Cambodia's economic growth. EZECOM has always supported young entrepreneurs and start-ups, believing that young people with such potential will play an important role in boosting the future of Cambodia's business as well as enhancing Cambodia's competitiveness in Region and on the world stage as well.
