(Phnom Penh): Mr. Hang Chuon Naron, Minister of Education, Youth and Sports, stated on July 2, 2018, the Ministry of Education is still stricter than last year in the 2017-2018 Higher Secondary Diploma Examination (Bakdup). More with more than 6,000 Anti-Corruption Observers and more than 30,000 keynote speakers.
This statement was made by Mr. Hang Chuon Naron during a press conference on the preparation of the Higher Secondary Diploma Examination and Completion on the afternoon of July 2, 2018.
Mr. Hang Chuon Naron confirmed that this year's Baccalaureate exam is restricted from outside the examination center to inside the examination center by not allowing candidates to bring copies of documents, telephones and other electronic devices into the examination center if candidates are found. Score zero. If a candidate scores zero on a subject, it automatically fails.
