Sar Eang, 40, a homemaker with a mental illness, and her husband Vann Ruon, 45, a factory worker, have two sons in their care. Vann Phearun, 14 years old, has the same mental illness as the first child living in the rented room above, his hometown is Stung Chey village, Kong Chey commune, Ou Raing Ov district, Tbong Khmum province.
