Key remarks by Samdech Techo Hun Sen at the inauguration ceremony of Phsar Dei Huy flyover worth $ 17 million
The inauguration of this new achievement, which has great benefits in relieving traffic congestion, was presided over by Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia.
The following are the main remarks of Samdech Techo Hun Sen:
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the credit for the construction of the Phsar Dei Huy flyover was made during Chinese President Xi Jinping's visit to Cambodia.
* The Prime Minister stated that the new flyover not only serves the passage of the Boulevard of the Russian Federation, but also connects to the Second Ring Road.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that after the day of liberation on January 7, 1979, even the imagination never thought that Phnom Penh was growing as it is today.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen has warned people living along National Road 5 from the base of the Chroy Changvar Bridge to the Prek Pnov Bridge that there will be no expansion, do not worry.
According to Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the compulsion to stop the expansion of this section of road due to the large impact on the people by the project to expand this road to Kob Srov Dam instead.
* Samdech Techo stated that Cambodia has only 20 years of full development opportunity, while China has been developing the country since 1969 and has been reforming its economy for 40 years, which requires Cambodia to run after another 20 years.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen would like to thank the people who supported the Cambodian People's Party and Samdech to continue to develop the country.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the establishment of the Asian Infrastructure Investment Bank is in response to the need to build infrastructure in member countries.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia's support for China to become a member of the United Nations is a long-term vision of King Norodom Sihanouk.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that if China does not become a member of the United Nations, the end of the war in Vietnam may not be over.
* The head of the Royal Government stated that there is no loss in strengthening relations with China, and not only Cambodia, but also ASEAN as a whole.
* Samdech Techo stated that the statue of Samdech and His Majesty King Norodom Sihamoni will continue to march in accordance with the Royal Decree of Samdech Preah Borom Ratanakoth to strengthen the Cambodian-Chinese friendship.
* The Prime Minister stated that there should be no confusion about the presence of Chinese in Cambodia, the presence of Chinese in Cambodia to work on hundreds of construction sites in Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that no one can stop China's progress and this progress will help other countries.
* The Prime Minister said that just talking about hydropower, if China does not come to invest, no country will come to invest in hydropower in Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen called on all drivers not to drive while intoxicated, but to respect the law and love their lives and the lives of others.
* Samdech Techo issued an order to take action against the civil society group of the polling station after finding that they were inciting the people that the ink on the election day had ink on the hands, which caused death 24 hours after the dip. Hands.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen called Brad Adam a crazy doctor. Samdech also told Brad Adams that the army, the police force are the protectors of national security and the Royal Government.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the action plan of the Election Situation Room was closely monitored by the authorities. The Prime Minister said that this act could not be tolerated.
* The Prime Minister stated loudly that not bowing to foreigners leads to the destruction of the nation.
* The head of the Royal Government continued that Samdech is not wrong in leading the people and the armed forces to protect national independence.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen also called on the people to help arrest the group of people who whispered about the ink dipping their hands and leading them to death after soaking for 24 hours.
