The Minister expressed his confidence on the occasion of presiding over the inauguration ceremony of the new administrative building of Battambang Provincial Department of Commerce, which was held on the morning of July 2, 2018 with the participation of leaders and government officials. Of relevant institutions, councilors and authorities of Battambang province, about 200 businessmen and traders.
On that occasion, Minister Pan Sosak considered the new administration building of the Department of Commerce as a source of pride for the Ministry of Commerce and the Royal Government under the leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, and a new achievement that shows the progress of the infrastructure sector in Cambodia. In Battambang province, which is a potential province for national trade.
The Minister urged the officials of the Department of Commerce to strengthen cooperation with local authorities to better serve the people and to promote the Royal Government's in-depth reform program and the Ministry of Commerce's policy on facilitation. Trade.
"I urge civil servants of the Department of Commerce to strictly avoid demanding informal fees from producers and traders, which is contrary to the content of the joint declaration on the public service package: between the Ministry of Commerce and the Ministry of Economy and Finance." Mr. Pan Sosak emphasized.
In addition, Minister Pan Sosak also thanked and commended the Battambang Provincial Administration and relevant departments and units, as well as the National Technical Committee for cooperating in the construction of this new administrative building to serve the development of trade and economy in response. Most wishes of the people and the private sector in Battambang.
