Senior Minister Serey Kosal Continues to Meet People in Thmar Puok and Phnom Srok Districts, People Commit to Vote for CPP
(Banteay Meanchey): Senior Minister Serey Kosal, Deputy Chairman of the National Assistance Team for Banteay Meanchey Province, on July 1, 2018, continued to meet with the people of Kork Bathin Commune, Thmar Puok District, which was a base for resistance during the war and Poi Char Commune, Phnom District. The district has more than 1,700 people.
Speaking on that occasion, Senior Minister Serey Kosal also sent a message of greetings to all members of the people from Samdech Techo Hun Sen and Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen.
The Senior Minister mentioned the most bitter history and suffering that the Cambodian people experienced during the actual struggle in Kork Kathin commune, which was a tripartite battlefield during the war, and at that time there were no political parties or people who claimed that As patriots, they came out to save the nation, only the three princes who led the liberation and construction of the nation from scratch and brought peace and stability throughout the country.
The Senior Minister emphasized that without the win-win policy of the Royal Government, the war in Cambodia is still not over. Get hard. However, without January 7, there would be no peace, stability and development in all areas as it is today.
He also pointed out the tricks of the former CNRP, which incited separatism, wanted to increase the color revolution movement to overthrow the legitimate government until it was dissolved by the Supreme Court, all of which originated from the former CNRP. Internal divisions and betrayal of each other.
At the same time, Senior Minister Serey Kosal also called on the people to go to the polls for the 6th National Assembly election, which will take place on July 29, 2018 and vote for the Cambodian People's Party under the leadership of Samdech Techo. Hun Sen to maintain peace, stability, development of the country towards progress.
In response, all the people are determined to go to the polls for the CPP in the future because they love peace and need further development. Finally, Senior Minister Serey Kosal prepared a solidarity dinner with more than 1,700 people.
Court Detains Murderer Who Killed a Broker's in Prey Sar Prison
(Phnom Penh): Mr. Im Vannak, Investigating Judge of the Phnom Penh Municipal Court, on the evening of July 1, 2018, decided to detain three perpetrators in connection with the murder of a prostitute and drop their bodies. Disposed of in a sewer, imprisoned, awaiting a procedural trial.
The investigating judge's decision came after Deputy Prosecutor Song Chhavamorn charged the suspects with "premeditated murder" under Article 200 of the Penal Code.
Please be informed that the Criminal Police Department of the Ministry of Interior, in cooperation with the Phnom Penh Municipal Police and the Prey Veng Provincial Police, brought two murderers to point out and imitate the place where they beat and killed a female businessman and dropped the body. Dumped into a sewer on Street 371, Obek Kam Village, Sangkat Obek Kam, Khan Sen Sok on June 29, 2018.
Colonel Cheav Vibol, director of the Criminal Police Bureau of the Criminal Police Department, told Fresh News that the operation to crack down on the perpetrators of the killings was carried out on the orders of General Sant Neth Savoeun, the commissioner. National Police and Lt. Gen. Sok Khemrin, Director of the Criminal Police Department, and led the operation by Lt. Gen. Neng Chou, Deputy Director of the Criminal Police Department.
According to the confessions of the three suspects, Art Oeun's's owed 200,000 riel to the victim. Seeing that the victim had a motorcycle and jewelry attached, the three suspects also planned to kill and rob the victim.
At around 4 pm on June 19, 2018, while the victim entered the house of Art Oeun, located in a rented house in Trea 2 Village, Sangkat Stung Meanchey, Khan Meanchey, Suddenly, Ath Chay rushed to beat the victim. On the floor, At Chay shakes hands and Keo Sophanit shakes his feet. Meanwhile, Art Oeun took the victim's clothes and strangled him to death.
According to Mr. Chiao Vibol, prior to the operation to arrest the three suspects, the Criminal Department received a complaint from the victim's relatives, claiming that a family member had been missing for 10 days. After receiving the complaint, the Criminal Police Department of the Ministry of Interior conducted a search until the target was identified and arrested the three perpetrators in collaboration with the Phnom Penh Municipal Police and Prey Veng Provincial Police.
