In accordance with the order of Samdech Techo Prime Minister Hun Sen, the Ministry of Commerce has issued a new notification on the pricing of fuel to be sold at stations for 15 days from July 1 to 15, 2018 .
The Ministry of Commerce stipulates that all gas stations must sell regular gasoline at no more than 3,950 riel and diesel at 3,750 riel per liter. But the price of super petrol is not included in the ministry's announcement.
