According to the announcement of Phnom Penh Capital Administration, the inauguration ceremony of the Cambodia-China Sen Sok Friendship Flyover will take place from 06:00 to 12:00 with 10 participants. 700 people presided over by Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia and Samdech Kittiprittbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen.
