(Preah Sihanouk): Major General Chuon Narin, Police Commissioner of Preah Sihanouk Province, has ordered the Special Forces to inspect and enforce the road traffic law, especially for drivers who do not have a driver's license or have an incorrect international driver's license, as well as vehicles. No license plate.
