The Outstanding Student Graduation Ceremony was presided over by Dr. M. Koch, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports, Representative of the Minister of Education, Youth and Sports, and attended by Mr. and Mrs. Parents and Guardians of Students. Lots of crowds.
