The rector said that this was done to ensure that the subject education was effective and in line with modern educational philosophy, but while maintaining the values of the national language and culture, the school recruited ethnic experts. Cambodians who have completed a Master's degree in Education from Australia to develop a curriculum for this subject as well as lead the work of this brand new project.
