He said students can take an international high school diploma as officially as a national high school diploma, such as applying to a local university or higher education institution or applying for a job in the public and private sectors. Without having to prove the equivalent.
Please note that each student selected from all grades from Kindergarten to 11th grade will receive a 50% scholarship for the next school year based on good character, good communication and extracurricular activities. More.
