General Commission of National Police starts restricting the driving of foreigners on Cambodian territory
(Phnom Penh): Speaking at the dissemination session on the inspection of international driving licenses on the morning of June 29, 2018, General Him Yan, Deputy Commissioner of the National Police in charge of traffic, said that all capitals and provinces Must properly check the driver's license of foreigners, because some foreigners only have a driver's license, but do not have documents and driving licenses in Cambodia.
The general said that from now on, any foreigner must have a driver's license, a passport and must bring their driver's license to the relevant authorities in the second country to copy the original. Foreigners can have the right to drive a vehicle in a second country.
The general said that if they only have their driver's license and do not have a copy of the law of the second country and order a vehicle in the second country, then the foreigner must take legal action if the second country. Offenses related to traffic accidents, but if there is a suspicion that foreigners use the driver's license illegally in our country, police officers have the right to request confirmation from the embassy of that country.
Separately, Mr. So Pisey, Deputy Director General of the General Department of Land Transport of the Ministry of Public Works and Transport, also confirmed that there are five types of driver's licenses in Cambodia, and he also confirmed the same as General Him Yan. .
Mr. So Pisey stated that a foreigner who has the right to drive a vehicle in a second country can only do so if the foreigner has a national international driver's license and that international driver's license is a foreign driver's license made in his / her own country and must obtain that license. Copy the original from the second country with your passport and driver's license along with the second country's driver's license recognized by the authorities of the second country.
